<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan Alcatel unit raises profits.</title>
<headline>Moroccan Alcatel unit raises profits.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcatel Alsthom Maroc, a subsidiary of French telecommunications company Alacatel Alsthom, showed a net profit of 27.7 million dirhams ($2.97 million) in 1996 from 20.6 million dirhams in 1995.</p>
<p>Its results published on Friday also showed a turnover of 757 million dirhams for 1996. Comparative figures for the previous year were not available.</p>
</text>
